14.109.7 emacsvox-epub Options
------------------------------

 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-epub-bookshelf-directory
     Directory where we keep .bsf files defining various bookshelves.

     Default Value:

     "~/EBooks/bsf/"


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-epub-calibre-root-dir
     Root of Calibre library.

     Default Value:

     "~/EBooks/calibre"


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-epub-gutenberg-mirror
     Base URL  for Gutenberg mirror.

     Default Value:

     "http://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/"


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-epub-gutenberg-suffix
     Suffix of book type we retrieve.

     Default Value:

     ".epub.noimages"


 -- Variable: User Option emacsvox-epub-library-directory
     Directory under which we store Epubs.

     Default Value:

     "~/EBooks/"



