14.136 emacsvox-gptel
=====================

GPTEL == A simple LLM client for Emacs.  gptel supports ChatGPT, Claude,
Gemini, and local models via streaming responses in buffers.  It
provides a transient menu for model/backend selection and works in
dedicated chat buffers or inline in any buffer.  This module
speech-enables gptel.

