14.168 emacsvox-mu4e
====================

MU4E == mu4e: an Emacs front-end for the mu mail indexer/searcher.  This
module speech-enables mu4e for use on the Emacsvox audio desktop.  It
covers the four main mu4e views: - Main view (dashboard) - Headers view
(message list) - Message view (reading a message) - Compose view
(writing a message)


